      "kit_id": "poe1-ball-lightning",
      "missing_expression": "Ball Lightning's signature 'slow drift + 150ms tick + inverse-velocity (slower = more hits)' has no matching 26-geometry — approximated as a circle tick-AoE, same as the archmage BL delivery.",
      "proposed_fix_target": null,
      "proposed_fix_type": "none",
      "source_anchor": "Ball Lightning's signature 'slow drift + 150ms tick + inverse-velocity (slower = more hits)' has no matching 26-geometry — approximated as a circle tick-AoE, same as the archmage BL delivery. The mine throw/detonate chassis is modeled via trigger-grammar + activation-toggle. A player would keep the orb-zap and mine-laying feel but lose the fine positional skill of drifting the orb slowly through a pack to maximize hits."
    }
  ],
