        "verbatim": "Projectile delivery with small-radius AoE. Base projectile speed ~48 units/sec. Base radius 18 units (post-3.12 nerf from 22). Lightning bolts strike every 150ms inside the AoE. Slower Projectiles increases dwell time, increasing hits per target."
