      "payload_json": {
        "description": "Throw mines with right-click; each mine generates a Ball Lightning orb that drifts and zaps nearby enemies every 150ms. Detonate mines (key 'd') to trigger them simultaneously. For bosses, pre-plant mines before spawn. Slower Projectiles makes the orb drift more slowly, increasing hit count per target. Loop: throw mines → detonate → re-throw."
      },
      "source_url": "https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/2755952"
