  "mapping": {
    "authored_date": "2026-07-18",
    "deviation_notes": "Ball Lightning's signature 'slow drift + 150ms tick + inverse-velocity (slower = more hits)' has no matching 26-geometry — approximated as a circle tick-AoE, same as the archmage BL delivery. The mine throw/detonate chassis is modeled via trigger-grammar + activation-toggle. A player would keep the orb-zap and mine-laying feel but lose the fine positional skill of drifting the orb slowly through a pack to maximize hits.",
    "grade": "CLOSE",
    "kit_id": "poe1-ball-lightning",
    "mapping_json": {
      "fidelity_notes": "Same GEOMETRY FRICTION as archmage (kit-4): the slow-drift + 150ms-tick + inverse-velocity orb has no clean 26-type; approximated as 'circle' tick-AoE. Here the orb IS the identity (contrast archmage where mana-scaling is the identity). Deployed via the MINE chassis (throw+detonate) — modeled with trigger_grammar (on-cast-linked -> linked-cast: mine-throw links the BL cast; detonate = activation) + resource activation-toggle for the throw/detonate rhythm; this is a delivery-chassis approximation, not a source-fact mint. Ailments: shock->sunder (false-friend) + blind (Saboteur 'Born in the Shadows' blinds nearby = engine blind, accuracy-tax). Slower-Projectiles support -> traits (increases dwell => hit-count). The mine-detonate loop is DEPTH-1 (throw links, detonate fires) — within MAX_CHAIN_DEPTH.",
      "motion_frame": "mine-layer caster: throw mines that each spawn a drifting zap-orb, detonate to trigger; pre-plant for bosses, re-throw to sustain",
